{"lines":[{"w":0.058549753824869821,"t":"Test 4","y":0.073787215751697888,"x":0.80061234103919499,"h":0.015216266118704858,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.071265384841795482,"t":"meet to drink coffee and chat about issues of the day. But at the time, this chance to share","h":0.022991467811795618,"y":0.11393863056609976,"w":0.67332143147786461},{"h":0.019341486619505965,"w":0.65817331949869795,"c":1,"t":"ideas and opinions was seen as something that was potentially dangerous, and in 1623","x":0.069405340806741031,"y":0.1324620822143634},{"y":0.14766944888446398,"x":0.069414126874786417,"w":0.65630711873372394,"h":0.019586658293557657,"c":1,"t":"the ruler of Constantinople demanded the destruction of all the coffee houses in the city."},{"y":0.16411523344500711,"h":0.019400949717642724,"w":0.68067403157552087,"x":0.069443178310057238,"c":1,"t":"although after his death many new ones opened, and coffee consumption continued. In the"},{"x":0.069425312086259461,"y":0.17951738949186014,"t":"seventeenth century, coffee drinking spread to Europe, and here too coffee shops became","w":0.67885192871093758,"h":0.019928448904888652,"c":1},{"y":0.19691088097620557,"t":"places where ordinary people, nearly always men, could meet to exchange ideas. Because","x":0.069473569025353801,"c":1,"w":0.68060328165690098,"h":0.017254226375071346},{"c":1,"x":0.069448003232799399,"t":"of this, some people said that these places performed a similar function to universities. The","y":0.21178137505711447,"w":0.67878606160481758,"h":0.018287826950751152},{"w":0.69762908935546875,"t":"opportunity they provided for people to meet together outside their own homes and to discuss","c":1,"x":0.069421381867770623,"h":0.019379540865296918,"y":0.22695199603399541},{"c":1,"y":0.24209892783317943,"w":0.74275980631510419,"x":0.069385075648890793,"t":"the topics of the day had an enormous impact on social life, and many social movements and Q33","h":0.021594640138605237},{"t":"political developments had their origins in coffee house discussions.","w":0.50591517130533858,"x":0.069429006783826477,"h":0.018203529633020299,"y":0.25805302792514739,"c":1},{"h":0.016099747426265743,"y":0.29941860437299017,"c":1,"x":0.067669172089589905,"w":0.62969924926757814,"t":"In the late 1600s, the Yemeni monopoly on coffee production broke down and coffee"},{"w":0.68994049072265629,"t":"production started to spread around the world, helped by European colonisation. Europeans","c":1,"h":0.018203101615635653,"x":0.063879853342953985,"y":0.31488104527713046},{"x":0.065659356964926252,"y":0.32993579605411472,"h":0.020232916031817094,"w":0.65627675374348948,"c":1,"t":"set up coffee plantations in Indonesia and the Caribbean and production of coffee in the"},{"x":0.065655406220900173,"c":1,"y":0.34474987412958569,"w":0.65632904052734375,"h":0.020756797029061747,"t":"colonies skyrocketed. Different types of coffee were produced in different areas, and it's"},{"y":0.36039551284234062,"w":0.66764216105143226,"x":0.065633011092751062,"c":1,"t":"interesting that the names given to these different types, like Mocha or Java coffee, were","h":0.020502287575450806},{"x":0.065654007352598659,"w":0.66004521687825524,"h":0.019914819897948188,"t":"often taken from the port they were shipped to Europe from. But if you look at the labour","y":0.37667748435614312,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"system in the different colonies, there were some significant differences.","x":0.065698045234259206,"h":0.018656905666137646,"y":0.39334741536828566,"w":0.541545664469401},{"x":0.063774801573946951,"c":1,"t":"In Brazil and the various Caribbean colonies, coffee was grown in huge plantations and the","y":0.41669312805388126,"w":0.68263621012369791,"h":0.019680720794147177},{"x":0.065680071982254631,"w":0.66939961751302079,"y":0.43313965367479101,"h":0.019398280289276038,"c":1,"t":"workers there were almost all slaves. But this wasn't the same in all colonies; for example"},{"c":1,"h":0.019417831533890095,"t":"in Java, which had been colonised by the Dutch, the peasants grew coffee and passed","x":0.065643876749333765,"y":0.44838858105572088,"w":0.65067799886067701},{"h":0.018590986076202687,"c":1,"t":"a proportion of this on to the Dutch, so it was used as a means of taxation. But whatever","y":0.46468539909860873,"x":0.065677523284749864,"w":0.66187520345052087},{"w":0.67686533610026045,"c":1,"h":0.018819835979709709,"t":"system was used, under the European powers of the eighteenth century, coffee production","x":0.065703536903995802,"y":0.48027511777447829},{"t":"was very closely linked to colonisation. Coffee was grown in ever-increasing quantities.","c":1,"h":0.01887307900885038,"y":0.49620124290051504,"w":0.64687001546223954,"x":0.065664463966715936},{"y":0.51137622710938702,"w":0.66005269368489594,"t":"to satisfy the growing demand from Europe, and it became nearly as important as sugar","h":0.019330043755879545,"c":1,"x":0.063770989844642592},{"x":0.063800925718527093,"c":1,"w":0.65999893188476555,"y":0.5274524236830731,"t":"production, which was grown under very similar conditions. However, coffee prices were","h":0.020069920625213844},{"c":1,"t":"not yet low enough for people to drink it regularly at home, so most coffee consumption still","x":0.063781999338096404,"y":0.54322114036759184,"w":0.6806899515787761,"h":0.019825057836017956},{"t":"took place in public coffee houses and it still remained something of a luxury item. In Britain,","w":0.69021367390950505,"y":0.55806134437837618,"h":0.021513081026783509,"c":1,"x":0.061871521090322075},{"x":0.32438127138235673,"t":"nd i segu lany a nome-","w":0.17942517598470054,"c":0.30000001192092896,"h":0.070278975860733173,"y":0.51940271485429623},{"t":"however, a new drink was introduced from China, and started to become popular, gradually","y":0.57422355233055788,"w":0.68081883748372396,"x":0.06372680526826846,"h":0.021483969703767647,"c":1},{"x":0.061940319367297721,"h":0.019499360555537026,"c":1,"w":0.701310068766276,"t":"taking over from coffee, although at first it was so expensive that only the upper classes could","y":0.59035321273972485},{"c":1,"w":0.68084370930989579,"x":0.063726621375626985,"t":"afford it. This was tea, and by the late 1700s it was being widely drunk. However, when the","y":0.60532527895049115,"h":0.021695124128136567},{"c":1,"x":0.06372937253850873,"y":0.62095211890866198,"h":0.020405369578679,"t":"USA gained independence from Britain in 1776, they identified this drink with Britain, and","w":0.6638860066731771},{"x":0.77443608950371468,"t":"Q34","c":1,"y":0.35029069769306809,"w":0.033834587732950894,"h":0.013081395234588844},{"w":0.61495086669921872,"y":0.66109688342343687,"h":0.019856471364450567,"c":1,"t":"So, by the early nineteenth century, coffee was already being widely produced and","x":0.063747919381565155},{"x":0.061944877142719484,"h":0.018378924033907396,"c":1,"y":0.67823113644464661,"t":"consumed. But during this century, production boomed and coffee prices started to fall. This","w":0.68439229329427087},{"h":0.017972031180043424,"c":1,"t":"was partly because new types of transportation had been developed which were cheaper and","y":0.6939229511974494,"x":0.06192473776719401,"w":0.69758921305338539},{"h":0.021478113787295472,"y":0.70768807491161323,"t":"more efficient. So now, working people could afford to buy coffee - it wasn't just a drink for","w":0.67512176513671873,"c":1,"x":0.061890284466391228},{"t":"the middle classes. And this was at a time when large parts of Europe were starting to work in","x":0.061906883696920684,"y":0.72496378465705369,"h":0.019261861261980595,"c":1,"w":0.69946248372395836},{"c":1,"w":0.69759633382161468,"h":0.018612396770803952,"y":0.74069373306480435,"x":0.061903268493825485,"t":"industries. And sometimes this meant their work didn't stop when it got dark; they might have"},{"h":0.019530041480325444,"c":1,"t":"to continue throughout the night. So, the use of coffee as a stimulant became important - it","y":0.75556345634086497,"x":0.060051003428346517,"w":0.68065968831380208},{"t":"wasn't just a drink people drank in the morning, for breakfast.","w":0.4567669169108074,"x":0.060150376014677015,"y":0.77325581382044017,"h":0.017471810271489696,"c":1},{"w":0.31015037536621093,"x":0.060150376081738892,"t":"There were also changes in cultivation ...","h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"y":0.79651162810011955},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.033834587732950894,"c":1,"t":"117","y":0.96802325583474047,"x":0.81015037521247191}],"w":2400,"h":3106}